////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// SampleShared - a dialogue meant to be reused from other files.
//
// Sample.dialogue pulls this in with include("SampleShared") and jumps here from MarkerSample.
// Nothing in this file knows who called it: it exits through "-> Marker(return)", which goes back
// to whichever node most recently declared {Marker=return}. That's the whole trick that lets one
// side-conversation be dropped into any number of events without duplicating it.
////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

# SampleShared:Stranger
[TestSpeaker]: The stranger looks up from the fire.
{OneShot}*Where are you headed? -> SampleShared:Stranger:Headed
{OneShot}*Got anything to trade? -> SampleShared:Stranger:Trade
*Step away -> Marker(return)

# SampleShared:Stranger:Headed
[TestSpeaker]: Nowhere. Everywhere. Same thing, these days.
=>SampleShared:Stranger

# SampleShared:Stranger:Trade
[TestSpeaker]: Only stories, and those I give away for free.
=>SampleShared:Stranger
